WEBVTT

00:16.474 --> 00:17.517
Ermes,

00:18.226 --> 00:20.186
how fast are we going right now?

00:20.270 --> 00:22.313
Is it 170kph? Or 200kph?

00:22.397 --> 00:23.231
What?

00:23.314 --> 00:25.734
We're ditching this ride. Emporio!

00:30.822 --> 00:34.325
But the first time
I fully caught sight of rods,

00:34.409 --> 00:36.369
it finally dawned on me.

00:36.453 --> 00:40.582
The first step on the moon
was made by humanity's willpower.

00:40.665 --> 00:44.210
On that same day,
humanity left the Earth and evolved.

00:44.294 --> 00:48.214
Mental evolution is invaluable!

00:50.258 --> 00:52.385
This is nothing

00:52.469 --> 00:54.262
compared to everything else
we've been through.

00:55.054 --> 00:57.474
Compared to finding that priest,

00:57.557 --> 00:59.100
this is nothing.

01:01.895 --> 01:03.104
This bitch!

01:03.188 --> 01:07.567
I'm mentally stronger than her.

01:10.361 --> 01:11.571
I'll kill you!

01:17.911 --> 01:19.454
Fuck.

01:22.207 --> 01:25.460
- Jolyne!
- Jolyne won!

01:26.294 --> 01:29.547
That is why the priest extracted
only his memory

01:30.048 --> 01:32.425
and kept him alive all this time.

01:33.218 --> 01:34.803
Weather Forecast.

01:37.180 --> 01:40.391
He is the priest's younger brother.

01:41.142 --> 01:43.144
Let's go to Orlando.

01:43.228 --> 01:45.188
We need to go find the priest.

03:17.155 --> 03:21.826
EPISODE 28: HEAVEN IS AT HAND:
THREE DAYS UNTIL THE NEW MOON

03:21.910 --> 03:22.994
GREEN DOLPHIN STREET PRISON

03:23.077 --> 03:24.162
ESCAPED FROM HELICOPTER

03:24.245 --> 03:25.496
ORLANDO

03:25.580 --> 03:27.582
CAPE CANAVERAL
SPACE CENTER

03:29.876 --> 03:35.131
ORLANDO, FLORIDA
10 HOURS BY CAR TO CAPE CANAVERAL

03:38.426 --> 03:41.054
Hurry! Prepare Emergency Room 3!

03:41.137 --> 03:43.806
Male, eight years old.
He's in critical condition.

03:43.890 --> 03:45.600
My baby, Mike!

03:45.683 --> 03:47.602
He will be okay. Everything will be fine.

03:51.731 --> 03:52.815
Hey, Jolyne.

03:52.899 --> 03:54.734
This is an urgent care facility.

03:54.817 --> 03:56.569
Is the priest really hiding here?

03:57.195 --> 03:58.279
He's here.

03:58.863 --> 03:59.948
I have no doubt.

04:00.531 --> 04:02.367
I don't know why he's here,

04:04.452 --> 04:06.329
but this is where we'll settle the score.

04:06.955 --> 04:10.333
THREE MORE DAYS UNTIL THE NEW MOON

04:11.584 --> 04:12.418
Emporio.

04:13.920 --> 04:15.380
Can you do me a favor?

04:15.463 --> 04:20.009
I want you to deliver my father's disc,
which you've kept safe for us.

04:20.093 --> 04:23.554
Call this number,
and the Speedwagon Foundation will come.

04:28.142 --> 04:29.686
I'm going inside with you.

04:29.769 --> 04:33.648
Of course you are,
but I want you to deliver the disc first.

04:33.731 --> 04:37.568
The priest must know that
I'm closing in on him.

04:38.611 --> 04:41.030
I don't want to be apart from you,

04:41.906 --> 04:42.782
but this is important.

04:47.537 --> 04:49.706
Hold onto this phone we took from Rikiel.

05:09.726 --> 05:13.771
Sorry to bother,
but I'd like your opinion.

05:14.355 --> 05:16.149
It concerns this meal.

05:16.232 --> 05:20.069
I want you to try it,
if only for a single bite.

05:20.153 --> 05:21.738
Versus.

05:30.371 --> 05:31.789
Try a bite.

05:37.754 --> 05:40.506
Tell me the ingredients.

05:40.590 --> 05:43.051
I can't eat shellfish.

05:43.134 --> 05:45.428
I'm very allergic to them.

05:51.434 --> 05:52.977
This is whitefish.

05:53.811 --> 05:55.521
Flounder, to be more precise.

05:56.397 --> 05:58.232
It also contains sliced asparagus.

05:58.316 --> 06:00.902
The asparagus is incorporated
into some ground crabmeat.

06:00.985 --> 06:02.779
It is then steamed like a flan.

06:03.863 --> 06:05.490
There's no shellfish in it.

06:06.199 --> 06:07.825
Excellent.

06:08.409 --> 06:09.619
I'm not done.

06:10.411 --> 06:13.581
Could I have another bite with the sauce?

06:14.457 --> 06:16.209
I smell something in the sauce.

06:17.043 --> 06:18.920
It may contain ground scallops

06:19.003 --> 06:21.214
mixed in with whipping cream.

06:30.056 --> 06:34.018
Unfortunately, it's just as I thought.
There's shellfish in this sauce.

06:35.728 --> 06:38.481
So your shoe size is 27cm?

06:39.273 --> 06:41.567
Will you stand up for me?

06:43.111 --> 06:47.406
Take your time so that the gunshot wound
on your leg won't open up.

06:49.117 --> 06:51.369
Height, 181cm.

06:52.286 --> 06:54.497
Weight, 72kg even.

06:55.456 --> 06:57.375
Size, 52.

06:57.917 --> 07:00.461
Watch size is two holes up.

07:01.254 --> 07:02.213
Correct.

07:03.714 --> 07:05.341
Interesting.

07:05.424 --> 07:08.261
Though I won't be able to enjoy this dish,

07:08.928 --> 07:12.473
you were able to discern
the scallop in the sauce.

07:13.349 --> 07:15.726
We share a similar sense of taste.

07:25.361 --> 07:27.113
Interesting indeed.

07:28.030 --> 07:30.324
Father Pucchi,

07:30.992 --> 07:32.535
what are you hinting at?

07:33.536 --> 07:36.205
I haven't seen my ability yet,

07:36.789 --> 07:39.709
while our enemy draws near by the second.

07:40.751 --> 07:42.295
I want to serve you.

07:43.379 --> 07:44.672
What should I do?

07:47.675 --> 07:48.801
This can't be helped.

07:49.302 --> 07:52.138
That in itself is not a problem.

07:55.099 --> 07:57.435
- Mike…
- Are you okay?

08:00.021 --> 08:01.022
He's really close.

08:01.647 --> 08:03.191
He's around here.

08:04.734 --> 08:08.779
You haven't seen your ability,
but that can't be helped.

08:09.655 --> 08:14.494
Let the power take its course,
and do not try to resist.

08:15.912 --> 08:18.456
Because reaching heaven

08:19.040 --> 08:21.959
means having these factors on our side.

08:23.002 --> 08:26.839
Jolyne may very well forget
to check this room.

08:27.965 --> 08:33.221
Anyway, I ordered this item because
it's supposed to be shellfish-free.

08:33.304 --> 08:35.556
Feel free to eat it.

08:39.852 --> 08:40.937
Father Pucchi.

08:42.813 --> 08:45.608
I… was…

08:48.236 --> 08:51.447
I was…

08:52.740 --> 08:56.369
I was shot.

08:56.452 --> 08:59.622
The ambulance was fun.

08:59.705 --> 09:03.209
But my dad hates me.

09:03.292 --> 09:05.336
My dad is the one…

09:05.419 --> 09:07.338
who shot me!

09:10.925 --> 09:12.802
Honey? Honey!

09:12.885 --> 09:14.262
Honey!

09:14.345 --> 09:15.471
He got shot!

09:18.015 --> 09:19.850
Honey, no!

09:30.528 --> 09:34.115
This room doesn't look right.

09:34.782 --> 09:36.993
Where is the priest?

09:38.035 --> 09:40.246
What is happening?

09:40.830 --> 09:41.998
This situation…

09:42.498 --> 09:46.961
I've no doubt it's the doing
of his new ally.

09:47.795 --> 09:51.841
But this doesn't seem like
a Stand ability.

09:52.425 --> 09:54.885
He was shot by a real bullet.

09:55.386 --> 09:56.971
And who is he?

09:57.054 --> 09:58.639
Who is this man?

09:58.723 --> 10:00.766
Why was he shot?

10:01.350 --> 10:04.312
He's an ordinary citizen!

10:05.813 --> 10:09.483
Evacuate everyone on this floor. Hurry!

10:09.567 --> 10:10.818
Y-yes sir.

10:10.901 --> 10:14.447
You two over there, evacuate!

10:14.530 --> 10:16.449
I'll call the police.

10:18.743 --> 10:21.871
I know, the man who got shot!

10:21.954 --> 10:24.373
They were the parents of that boy

10:24.457 --> 10:26.375
who rushed here in an ambulance!

10:27.209 --> 10:28.502
It might be a test shot…

10:30.880 --> 10:33.466
I don't know what the ability is about,

10:33.549 --> 10:36.385
but it could be a newly awakened ability.

10:36.469 --> 10:38.971
If so, the user would want
to know what it is

10:39.055 --> 10:40.890
by testing it out.

10:45.144 --> 10:46.145
What's this?

10:51.317 --> 10:52.985
They're on the move.

10:53.569 --> 10:54.570
The priest is on the run!

10:55.154 --> 10:57.073
He's inside this hole.

10:57.156 --> 10:59.283
I can sense him moving away.

11:08.584 --> 11:10.086
Listen Jolyne.

11:10.169 --> 11:12.588
Don't you dare go down that hole.

11:12.672 --> 11:15.132
Got that? I won't allow it.

11:15.216 --> 11:17.093
This is obviously a trap!

11:17.176 --> 11:22.348
We need to find out the connection
between this hole and the shooting.

11:22.431 --> 11:23.933
Until then, stay away from this hole!

11:34.485 --> 11:37.655
The hole goes sideways
to the hospital courtyard.

11:37.738 --> 11:39.240
I can't see any further.

11:42.493 --> 11:44.662
The enemy that's with the priest…

11:44.745 --> 11:48.082
His name is Versus.
Twenty-five years old, male.

11:48.165 --> 11:49.708
Listen, Jolyne.

11:49.792 --> 11:53.045
I'll say this again.
We won't go down this hole.

11:53.129 --> 11:54.755
We'll either wait for them to come out

11:54.839 --> 11:57.383
or chase them out like rabbits.

11:57.466 --> 12:01.137
Yes, this hole is an obvious trap.

12:01.720 --> 12:04.014
But what if the priest

12:04.098 --> 12:07.351
waits three more days in this hole,
until the new moon rises?

12:08.352 --> 12:10.980
Yes, the priest would do just that.

12:11.480 --> 12:14.859
He may even use this hole
to reach Cape Canaveral.

12:15.818 --> 12:17.987
In three days,
the priest will attain the power

12:18.070 --> 12:21.198
that he calls "reaching heaven."

12:22.116 --> 12:23.993
As of now, the priest's ability is limited

12:24.076 --> 12:26.996
to Pale Snake, which manipulates memories.

12:27.580 --> 12:28.873
We can still win.

12:29.457 --> 12:31.459
This is our only chance to stop him.

12:32.042 --> 12:33.294
We'll put him out of commission,

12:33.794 --> 12:36.630
or if things turn bleak,
we may even have to kill him.

12:38.215 --> 12:39.216
Hold on to this.

12:40.676 --> 12:42.428
Don't ever let go.

12:43.888 --> 12:45.431
Hey, Jolyne!

12:45.514 --> 12:47.308
What are you doing? I'm coming with you!

12:49.059 --> 12:51.896
If you come with me,
then who's going to pull me out?

12:52.396 --> 12:54.815
Wrap my thread around your body.

12:54.899 --> 12:56.567
I'll send a signal if I'm in danger.

12:56.650 --> 12:59.695
In that case,
do whatever it takes to pull me up.

13:00.738 --> 13:04.074
This is crazy. It's Jolyne's thread.

13:04.658 --> 13:08.621
How far can she actually go
while emitting this from her body?

13:21.884 --> 13:22.885
Jolyne?

13:24.011 --> 13:25.012
Jolyne!

13:25.095 --> 13:27.181
Why won't you answer me?

13:27.765 --> 13:28.766
Jolyne!

13:41.362 --> 13:43.697
This place…

13:49.245 --> 13:50.955
STAND NAME: NETHERWORLD
STAND MASTER: DONATELLO VERSUS

13:52.540 --> 13:53.791
This place…

13:57.878 --> 13:59.296
2005?

13:59.880 --> 14:01.131
What's going on?

14:08.055 --> 14:09.848
Look, it's her.

14:09.932 --> 14:11.684
She's tied to her thread.

14:13.269 --> 14:14.728
I'll go cut it.

14:15.563 --> 14:17.815
What is this place?

14:18.941 --> 14:21.902
Ermes, it's not looking good.
Can you hear me?

14:22.486 --> 14:23.696
Pull me up!

14:23.779 --> 14:26.949
Hurry, Ermes! This is bad.

14:27.032 --> 14:29.410
Get me out of here. They'll cut my thread!

14:36.542 --> 14:39.336
Ermes, what's taking you so long?

14:40.254 --> 14:42.256
Hurry, Ermes!

14:42.882 --> 14:44.717
Pull me up!

14:46.218 --> 14:47.469
Ermes!

14:48.929 --> 14:51.015
You should be able to hear me!

14:55.853 --> 14:59.356
Dammit, what's going on in there?

14:59.440 --> 15:01.233
She hasn't gone too deep.

15:07.448 --> 15:09.408
Ermes, faster!

15:09.491 --> 15:11.327
Pull me up with all your strength!

15:22.212 --> 15:25.215
I welcome you here,
even with your outside shoes on,

15:25.299 --> 15:27.384
and even if you didn't greet me.

15:28.177 --> 15:30.721
You may enter my hole as you wish.

15:31.388 --> 15:36.143
However, make sure to bring
all of this tightened rope with you.

15:38.562 --> 15:39.939
Stone Ocean!

15:50.699 --> 15:53.243
Hey Versus, are you hurt?

15:54.119 --> 15:57.665
Unlike you, who just
awakened to a Stand ability,

15:57.748 --> 16:01.502
Jolyne Cujoh has become an adept fighter
at The Green Dolphin.

16:02.127 --> 16:04.838
You could say she's a hardened fighter.

16:05.673 --> 16:08.926
She won't hesitate to nick a pen
from a passenger.

16:09.593 --> 16:12.012
Don't bother with Jolyne.

16:12.596 --> 16:14.974
You've done excellently, Versus.

16:15.599 --> 16:19.186
If Jolyne wants out, let her leave.

16:19.269 --> 16:23.649
She won't try to set foot
in this hole a second time.

16:24.233 --> 16:27.444
For the next three days,
we will bide our time in this hole.

16:27.528 --> 16:28.654
That will do.

16:30.239 --> 16:33.492
Can you hear me, Ermes? I see the light!

16:33.575 --> 16:36.829
I'm close to the exit. Pull me up!

16:36.912 --> 16:39.915
I can hear you, Jolyne!

16:40.499 --> 16:43.252
I caught a glimpse of you just now.
Are you hurt?

16:43.836 --> 16:46.213
What did you find down there?

16:46.296 --> 16:48.549
The enemy is looking up at me from below.

16:49.133 --> 16:52.469
But I also saw the priest down here.

16:52.553 --> 16:55.097
We have to think of other ways
to enter this hole.

16:55.180 --> 16:57.433
I would've been dead
if they cut off my thread.

17:05.649 --> 17:08.110
Now talk to me, will you?

17:08.694 --> 17:11.780
Huh, Ermes?

17:11.864 --> 17:15.075
How do you feel right now?

17:16.452 --> 17:21.165
You buried me alive
in a prison sewage pipe.

17:21.749 --> 17:27.755
How did it feel when
you finally avenged your sister?

17:29.089 --> 17:30.716
Sports Maximum!

17:32.926 --> 17:35.637
What's going on, Ermes? Get it together!

17:36.972 --> 17:37.973
Jolyne!

17:40.142 --> 17:43.395
The Earth records the past.

17:43.479 --> 17:45.272
It's like a magnetic tape,

17:45.355 --> 17:47.566
or a digital camera.

17:48.192 --> 17:50.778
It remembers the little boy

17:50.861 --> 17:53.572
who fell to the ground
after being shot by his father.

17:53.655 --> 17:55.657
Where the hell did you come from?

17:55.741 --> 18:00.245
It remembers a gangster
who was buried alive in a pipe.

18:00.329 --> 18:04.792
It also remembers every detail
of July 2005, seven years ago,

18:04.875 --> 18:10.005
when a commercial flight crashed
into the ground.

18:10.089 --> 18:13.509
Ermes, what're you doing up there?

18:13.592 --> 18:14.718
Ermes!

18:14.802 --> 18:16.845
Let go, jerk!

18:16.929 --> 18:19.473
This is Versus's ability.

18:19.556 --> 18:23.435
Netherworld excavates.

18:23.519 --> 18:25.312
It unearths memories!

18:25.395 --> 18:28.398
Fucker!

18:33.779 --> 18:36.156
Jolyne!

18:41.203 --> 18:43.664
Attention all passengers.

18:43.747 --> 18:49.253
It is July 21, 2005,
and time to destination is 21:33.

18:49.336 --> 18:51.672
This aircraft will crash to the ground.

18:51.755 --> 18:54.341
Please turn off all electronic devices,

18:54.925 --> 18:58.303
and fasten your seatbelt
at your lower waist.

19:00.264 --> 19:04.810
Also, the face of the passenger seated
at the rear gets lodged in my stomach,

19:07.020 --> 19:09.731
by the crash impact.

19:10.524 --> 19:12.025
What's going on?

19:12.109 --> 19:14.236
Dammit, where is it?

19:14.319 --> 19:16.363
Search for the exit, Ermes.

19:16.446 --> 19:20.701
What is this place? Is this an illusion?

19:20.784 --> 19:23.996
It was on the ceiling earlier.
Find the hole where we came from.

19:24.913 --> 19:27.457
The walls feel just as hard
as the inside of a real plane.

19:27.541 --> 19:28.834
We have to find the exit!

19:29.793 --> 19:31.962
Did anyone come to the hospital room?

19:32.462 --> 19:35.215
There was commotion
over the little boy's father,

19:35.299 --> 19:37.092
so the police should've come.

19:37.176 --> 19:38.468
Didn't you see them?

19:38.552 --> 19:42.055
I don't know, but even if they're there,

19:42.139 --> 19:45.309
I couldn't hear you outside the hole.

19:45.893 --> 19:47.477
Are we in a commercial plane?

19:47.561 --> 19:50.772
I didn't see anything like this
from above!

19:53.942 --> 19:56.862
Please do not punch the ceiling.

19:56.945 --> 19:59.781
Please sit and wait quietly.

20:00.699 --> 20:03.285
We will crash in less than three minutes.

20:04.828 --> 20:07.039
I want to speak with the pilot.

20:07.122 --> 20:09.791
Have him land the plane immediately.

20:09.875 --> 20:12.419
Take us to the cockpit!

20:12.920 --> 20:14.087
It's no use.

20:19.218 --> 20:21.261
We couldn't make an emergency landing.

20:21.887 --> 20:24.348
That's why we crashed.

20:24.431 --> 20:26.099
What's wrong with her?

20:27.017 --> 20:30.145
We all burned to death.

20:30.229 --> 20:32.439
When the plane crashed,

20:32.522 --> 20:34.274
there was an explosion.

20:34.358 --> 20:35.901
My body…

20:37.694 --> 20:43.742
Excuse me, I asked you to turn off
your electronic devices.

20:44.785 --> 20:47.704
This can't be.
I remember hearing about this incident.

20:47.788 --> 20:50.540
Flight 2882, en route to Dallas.

20:50.624 --> 20:53.919
This plane crashed close to Orlando
six or seven years ago.

20:54.002 --> 20:55.671
Are they ghosts…

20:55.754 --> 20:58.423
We're memories,
merely the facts of the event

20:58.507 --> 21:01.468
recorded by the Earth.

21:01.551 --> 21:04.263
Are we seriously about to crash?

21:10.269 --> 21:13.272
Can't you speed up the crash?

21:13.855 --> 21:17.109
I've been feeling
Weather Forecast's presence.

21:25.993 --> 21:29.288
They are really close to this hospital.

21:29.371 --> 21:34.001
Cut the chatter. You confuse me.

21:34.960 --> 21:36.878
Are you talking to me?

21:41.425 --> 21:44.970
Netherworld unearths memories.

21:45.512 --> 21:49.683
The time of the crash was set at 21:33.

21:50.434 --> 21:51.560
And please don't forget

21:51.643 --> 21:56.565
that I managed to drag Ermes along.

21:58.025 --> 22:00.360
I did it all for you.

22:01.236 --> 22:02.738
Leave this to me.

22:08.785 --> 22:13.540
TWO MINUTES UNTIL CRASH

23:41.294 --> 23:46.299
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
